WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.128 --> 00:00:12.989
ran to the ocean.

2
00:00:14.049 --> 00:00:17.310
Because he had worked at the orphanage, he was very strong.

3
00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:20.051
He swam through the waves easily.

4
00:00:20.792 --> 00:00:24.273
He swam so fast, he was able to swim with some dolphins.

5
00:00:24.293 --> 00:00:26.814
"Hello, dolphins!"

6
00:00:27.174 --> 00:00:28.015
Pinocchio called.

7
00:00:28.035 --> 00:00:30.616
"I am looking for a large whale.

8
00:00:31.212 --> 00:00:32.853
Do you know where I can find it?"

9
00:00:32.873 --> 00:00:37.235
"Yeah, yeah, yeah," the dolphins said.

10
00:00:38.596 --> 00:00:40.377
They swam a big circle around him.

11
00:00:41.198 --> 00:00:44.059
One dolphin came below Pinocchio to help him swim deeper.

12
00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.861
The dolphins swam off in a new direction.

13
00:00:47.721 --> 00:00:49.102
Pinocchio held on tightly.

14
00:00:49.122 --> 00:00:52.023
"Whee, this is fun!"

15
00:00:52.544 --> 00:00:53.684
he shouted through the bubbles.

16
00:00:55.185 --> 00:00:57.026
The dolphins dove deeper and deeper.

17
00:00:57.787 --> 00:01:00.048
Pinocchio could see something very big ahead.

18
00:01:00.572 --> 00:01:02.214
It looked like a big blue house.

19
00:01:02.834 --> 00:01:03.615
It was the whale!

20
00:01:04.175 --> 00:01:05.697
The dolphins swam near the whale.

21
00:01:05.717 --> 00:01:08.379
"Hi, big whale!"

22
00:01:08.919 --> 00:01:09.440
they called.

23
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:12.943
"Hello," the whale called back.

24
00:01:14.204 --> 00:01:18.247
When the whale opened its mouth to say hello, Pinocchio jumped inside.

25
00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:22.090
"It's so dark in here!"

26
00:01:22.711 --> 00:01:26.114
Pinocchio said, walking carefully along the whale's teeth.

27
00:01:26.134 --> 00:01:28.436
"It's nice and warm though."

28
00:01:29.324 --> 00:01:31.005
He walked deep into the whale's throat.

29
00:01:38.207 --> 00:01:42.248
As Pinocchio got closer to the whale's stomach, he noticed a bad smell.

30
00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:45.088
"Oh, that's gross!"

31
00:01:45.549 --> 00:01:45.989
he said.

32
00:01:46.009 --> 00:01:47.949
"What smells so bad?"

33
00:01:47.969 --> 00:01:50.150
"I do," said a voice.

34
00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.531
"Father?" Pinocchio called.

35
00:01:52.551 --> 00:01:55.792
"Pinocchio, is that you?"

36
00:01:56.252 --> 00:01:57.212
Geppetto called back.

37
00:01:57.992 --> 00:02:01.595
Even though they were inside a smelly fish, they had never been happier.

38
00:02:02.636 --> 00:02:05.137
They ran across the whale's stomach and held each other.

39
00:02:05.157 --> 00:02:08.280
"Oh, Father.

40
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:09.841
You are very thin.

41
00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:13.083
I am sorry it took me so long to find you.

42
00:02:13.744 --> 00:02:16.145
Please forgive me," Pinocchio said.

43
00:02:16.165 --> 00:02:19.628
"Pinocchio, how did you find me?

44
00:02:20.448 --> 00:02:21.729
I had given up hope.

45
00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:25.292
I thought you were lost too," said Geppetto.

46
00:02:26.528 --> 00:02:30.170
They both had many questions to ask and even more stories to tell.

47
00:02:31.091 --> 00:02:32.511
But the whale was swimming deeper.

48
00:02:32.531 --> 00:02:37.474
"Father, we must get out of this whale quickly," said Pinocchio.

49
00:02:37.494 --> 00:02:40.936
"It is no use," said Geppetto.

50
00:02:40.956 --> 00:02:45.779
"I have tried many times, but the whale will not open its mouth."

51
00:02:47.359 --> 00:02:49.300
Pinocchio remembered the story of Jonah.

52
00:02:50.101 --> 00:02:51.582
The whale had spit Jonah out.

53
00:02:52.402 --> 00:02:54.523
How could Pinocchio make this whale spit them out?

54
00:02:55.628 --> 00:02:56.348
Suddenly, he had an idea.

55
00:02:56.369 --> 00:02:59.991
"Father, climb with me up to the whale's mouth.

56
00:03:00.591 --> 00:03:02.032
Here, I will help you."

57
00:03:03.073 --> 00:03:06.075
Together, the two climbed up and sat on the whale's teeth.

58
00:03:06.095 --> 00:03:10.258
"Can you reach up and tickle the top of the whale's mouth?"

59
00:03:10.738 --> 00:03:11.539
Pinocchio asked.

60
00:03:11.559 --> 00:03:14.541
"I can try," answered Geppetto.

61
00:03:15.782 --> 00:03:17.783
He stood very tall and tickled the whale.

62
00:03:18.744 --> 00:03:20.665
The whale started to swim up very quickly.

63
00:03:21.225 --> 00:03:22.326
Its tongue started to jump.

64
00:03:25.524 --> 00:03:29.227
"Ahh-ahh-choo!" the whale said, and it sneezed them onto the sand.

65
00:03:29.247 --> 00:03:33.350
"Hooray, we made it!"

66
00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:34.691
cheered Pinocchio.

67
00:03:34.711 --> 00:03:37.953
"Oh, you are so smart, son!"

68
00:03:38.613 --> 00:03:39.234
said Geppetto.

69
00:03:40.154 --> 00:03:42.856
"How did you know to tickle the whale?"

70
00:03:42.876 --> 00:03:48.620
"I got the idea from something I learned at a school," Pinocchio said, smiling.

71
00:03:50.061 --> 00:03:53.604
Just then, the whale began to slide up onto the sand and speak.

72
00:03:54.172 --> 00:03:55.753
Its voice was soft and pretty.

73
00:03:55.793 --> 00:03:59.534
"Well done, Pinocchio," it said.

74
00:04:00.495 --> 00:04:03.396
"You have proven yourself to be a good boy.

75
00:04:04.196 --> 00:04:05.817
You have honored your father.

76
00:04:06.657 --> 00:04:09.278
You have been obedient and generous.

77
00:04:10.159 --> 00:04:12.339
You have risked your life to save him."

78
00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.040
Suddenly, the whale vanished.

79
00:04:15.541 --> 00:04:17.421
In its place stood the Blue Fairy.

80
00:04:17.441 --> 00:04:19.442
"Blue Fairy!

81
00:04:19.942 --> 00:04:20.983
You were the whale?"

82
00:04:21.503 --> 00:04:23.504
Pinocchio asked, very surprised.

83
00:04:24.328 --> 00:04:29.372
"Yes. I kept Geppetto safe until you learned to be a good boy.

84
00:04:30.452 --> 00:04:31.693
Farewell, gentlemen.

85
00:04:32.594 --> 00:04:37.717
I wish you a happy life together," she said, and the Blue Fairy flew away.

86
00:04:40.499 --> 00:04:42.381
Pinocchio and Geppetto waved good-bye.

87
00:04:42.901 --> 00:04:45.203
As Pinocchio waved, he looked at his hand.

88
00:04:45.863 --> 00:04:47.704
It was the hand of a real boy.

89
00:04:47.724 --> 00:04:51.147
"Ah! I'm a real boy!

90
00:04:51.167 --> 00:04:52.768
Father, look!

91
00:04:53.836 --> 00:04:54.557
I'm really real!"

92
00:04:55.018 --> 00:04:55.538
he cried.

93
00:04:56.259 --> 00:05:00.124
Father and son laughed and hugged and danced all the way home.
